WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
If you go to venture capital, and you go

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:05.600
to Silicon Valley,

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.680
50% of the dollars they raise are spent

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.760
