00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:11.200
for acquiring customers is distribution.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:13.600
You went and sort of built the

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.840
distribution, and then decided, "Hey,

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.760
these are the things I'm going to bet

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.200
